<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">5. To re-elect John-Paul Backwell
as a Class I Director for a three-year term, who retires by rotation in accordance with Regulation 161 of the constitution of the Company
and, being eligible, offers himself for re-election. Disapplication of Pre-emption Rights.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; border-collapse: collapse">
