<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">6. Conditional on Resolution
3, as a special resolution, to grant the Directors the authority to issue shares for cash without applying statutory pre-emption rights,
valid until 25 June 2030.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

